    "body": "If the item type of a container is declared as a C type, we must still coerce a value of the expected C type to a Python object on index assignments. The type of the item in the container is always a plain Python object, regardless of the declared item type.\r\n\r\nFixes https://github.com/cython/cython/pull/7689",
